# Shadow NEW-golden paper agents — SECOND Alpaca PAPER account.
#
# These agents run main's NEW-golden code (via the .worktree-main checkout) to build a real
# forward paper track record for the new goldens, WITHOUT disturbing the old-golden agents.
# Use a DIFFERENT paper account from the one the old-golden agents trade, so the two equity
# curves stay cleanly separated (no shared positions / no order collisions).
#
# Copy this file to options_agent/.env.shadow (gitignored) and paste the 2nd paper account's
# key pair. ALPACA_PAPER=true keeps everything on the paper endpoint (this is NOT real money).

ALPACA_API_KEY=your_2nd_PAPER_account_key
ALPACA_SECRET_KEY=your_2nd_PAPER_account_secret
ALPACA_PAPER=true
